730590105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20744,"speakerName":"ハイヤーム","textMapHash":290599330,"text":"ははっ…君たちはこの間の…","nextNodeIds":[730590106]},{"nodeId":730590106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":508837138,"text":"そう！オイラたちは「ジエマン」——勇敢な若者だ！","nextNodeIds":[730590107]},{"nodeId":730590107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20744,"speakerName":"ハイヤーム","textMapHash":4092428434,"text":"ふむ…では教えてくれんかの。「アランナラ」、彼らはわしを覚えていたかね？わしらみんなを？","nextNodeIds":[730590108]},{"nodeId":730590108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2194735938,"text":"えっと…それが…","nextNodeIds":[730590109,730590112]},{"nodeId":730590109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3096829042,"text":"#うん、{M#君}{F#あなた}を覚えてたよ。","nextNodeIds":[730590110]},{"nodeId":730590110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2592501370,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[730590111]},{"nodeId":730590111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20744,"speakerName":"ハイヤーム","textMapHash":3187401922,"text":"そうか…じゃがわしには彼らの姿も、わしを恋しがる声も、もう認識できん…実に残念じゃ。","nextNodeIds":[730590114]},{"nodeId":730590114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20744,"speakerName":"ハイヤーム","textMapHash":2894877114,"text":"ほほっ…わしにはもう彼らは見えんからのう。年を取りすぎたんじゃ。今や、姿も声も認識できない…全ては過ぎ去ってしまったこと。","nextNodeIds":[730590115]},{"nodeId":730590115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20744,"speakerName":"ハイヤーム","textMapHash":1035055522,"text":"ゴホゴホッ…失礼。ではわしはこれで。もう、奇跡を待つしかないんじゃろうな…","nextNodeIds":[730590116]},{"nodeId":730590116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20744,"speakerName":"ハイヤーム","textMapHash":2299435666,"text":"奇跡は理解することも、追い求めることもできない。ただ待つのみじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[730590117]},{"nodeId":730590117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":2301057474,"text":"ハイヤームはよろよろと立ち去った…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":730590112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"sp