アランナキン、アランガル。始めよう、儀式を。","nextNodeIds":[730590208]},{"nodeId":730590208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20578,"speakerName":"アランナガ","textMapHash":3168236146,"text":"「帰ろう、帰ろう、花園の夢、森の記憶…」","nextNodeIds":[730590209]},{"nodeId":730590209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20576,"speakerName":"アランナキン","textMapHash":1276250594,"text":"「迎えよう、ボクら」","nextNodeIds":[730590210]},{"nodeId":730590210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20576,"speakerName":"アランナキン","textMapHash":1451588826,"text":"「深き睡夢に、消えぬ喜び」","nextNodeIds":[730590211]},{"nodeId":730590211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20577,"speakerName":"アランガル","textMapHash":2600429098,"text":"「祝おう、ボクら」","nextNodeIds":[730590212]},{"nodeId":730590212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20577,"speakerName":"アランガル","textMapHash":95261938,"text":"「ザクロが歌い、リンゴがパチパチ手を叩く！」","nextNodeIds":[730590213]},{"nodeId":730590213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":9132666,"text":"アランナラたちは乾燥した花を植えた。歌声が風に揺れ、花が奇跡のように息を吹き返した…","nextNodeIds":[730590214]},{"nodeId":730590214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":574646834,"text":"うわぁ…三つの花が生き返ったぞ！","nextNodeIds":[730590215]},{"nodeId":730590215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20578,"speakerName":"アランナガ","textMapHash":1338928146,"text":"そうさ。これは…慈悲だ、「マウティイェマ」。つまり、カノジョは記憶に、再生のチャンスを与えようとしてる。","nextNodeIds":[730590216]},{"nodeId":730590216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20576,"speakerName":"アランナキン","textMapHash":1882310586,"text":"そう！ボクたちがキミたちを忘れてしまっても、記憶は…えっと、葉脈や根系に溶けて、緑の葉っぱや年輪になる。","nextNodeIds":[730590217]},{"nodeId":730590217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20577,"speakerName":"アランガル","textMapHash":2033171554,"text":"ひょっとしたら、ぷくぷくの虫になって他の虫に食べられて、食べた虫が草木に栄養を残して、ボクたちみんなを育ててくれるのかもな！","nextNodeIds":[730590218]},{"nodeId":730590218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3405176554,"text":"でも…おまえたちはやっぱりオイラたちを忘れる。そうだろ？","nextNodeIds":[730590219]},{"nodeId":730590219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20578,"speakerName":"アランナガ","textMapHash":3938305514,"text":"うん…だってキミやボクのものじゃないんだ、記憶は。…過去に経験したこと、ボクら、もう森のあらゆる草木に分けてしまった…","nextNodeIds":[730590220]},{"nodeId":730590220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4273700730,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[730590221]},{"nodeId":730590221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20576,"speakerName":"アランナキン","textMapHash":2516003914,"text":"でもそれでもいい。ボクたちはまた新しく友達になった。そうだろ？","nextNodeIds":[730590222]},{"nodeId":730590222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20577,"speakerName":"アランガル","textMapHash":260835418,"text":"そう！新しい友達だ！","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7305903,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":true,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","beginCond":[{"param":["7305903","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"par